        <tbody>
'''

for _, row in price_stats.iterrows():
    ratio = row['range'] / row['iqr'] if row['iqr'] > 0 else float('inf')
    if ratio > 5:
        interp = 'High outlier-driven spread — extreme prices at a small number of stations'
    elif ratio > 3:
        interp = 'Moderate tail — some stations price far from the central market'
    else:
        interp = 'Relatively tight — most stations price within a narrow band'
    html += f'''<tr>
        <td style="font-weight:600;">{row['fuel_type']}</td>
        <td>{row['iqr']:.1f}p</td>
        <td>{row['range']:.1f}p</td>
        <td>{ratio:.1f}x</td>
        <td style="text-align:left; font-size:12px;">{interp}</td>
    </tr>'''

html += '''</tbody></table>

    <p>The <strong>IQR is the more policy-relevant metric</strong> for assessing the typical consumer experience. While the full range captures extreme outliers (which may reflect very remote locations or pricing errors), the IQR represents the band within which most consumers transact.</p>

    <div class="callout warning">
        <strong>Policy relevance:</strong> A large gap between IQR and total range — particularly for B7_STANDARD — suggests that while most stations are competitive, a subset of forecourts may be charging significantly above the market rate. This warrants closer investigation into whether these outliers are geographically concentrated (motorway services, rural areas) or reflect a lack of local competition.
    </div>
</div>
'''

# Section 4: Update Freshness
html += f'''
<div class="section" id="update-freshness">
    <h2>4. Retailer Reporting Freshness Analysis</h2>

    <p>The lag between <code>source_updated_at</code> (when the retailer last confirmed or changed the price) and <code>recorded_at</code> (when the data aggregator captured it) is a proxy for data freshness. Long lags may indicate infrequent retailer reporting, reducing the reliability of price comparisons for consumers and regulators.</p>

    <div class="kpi-row">
        {kpi_card(f'{lag_stats_full["50%"]:.1f}h', 'Median Update Lag', '#203a43')}
